# Vulnerabilities that `scripts/release/image.sh scan` accepts (Trivy's ignore file: one ID per
# line). Each entry names the image, why the fixed version cannot be taken now (for a runner or
# compiler: the SDK version is part of what the image measures, and changing it needs
# requalification), who accepted it, and the date it is reviewed again.

# qiskit 1.2.4 (qiskit, pennylane-default, pennylane-lightning) and 0.45.3 (qrisp, torchquantum):
# CVE-2025-2000 is code execution while reading a QPY file (qiskit.qpy.load). No runner reads QPY:
# every runner receives OpenQASM 2.0 text (checked 2026-11-01: no qpy reference in runners/ or
# shared/). The fixed qiskit (1.4.2) is another measured SDK version and needs requalification.
# Accepted by Shaswato Sarker, 2026-11-01; reviewed again by 2027-05-01.
CVE-2025-2000 exp:2027-05-01

# torch 2.2.2+cpu (torchquantum): CVE-2025-32434 is code execution in torch.load with
# weights_only=True. The runner never calls torch.load; torchquantum's only calls are in its
# dataset classes (torchquantum/dataset/vowel.py), which the runner never builds. The fixed torch
# (2.6.0) is another measured SDK version and needs requalification.
# Accepted by Shaswato Sarker, 2026-11-01; reviewed again by 2027-05-01.
CVE-2025-32434 exp:2027-05-01

# qiskit 1.2.4 and 0.45.3 (the five runners above): CVE-2025-1403 is denial of service while reading
# a QPY file. No runner reads QPY (see CVE-2025-2000); the fixed qiskit (1.3.0) is another measured
# SDK version. Accepted by Shaswato Sarker, 2026-11-02; reviewed again by 2027-05-01.
CVE-2025-1403 exp:2027-05-01

# protobuf 4.25.9 (cirq, qsim-cirq): CVE-2026-0994 is a recursion-depth bypass when parsing
# protobuf data, a denial of service. The runners never parse protobuf from a request (they take
# OpenQASM text); protobuf is loaded by cirq_google, which pytket-cirq imports, and cirq-google 1.4.1
# requires protobuf < 5 (fixed: 5.29.6, 6.33.5). Moving it means another Cirq SDK version.
# Accepted by Shaswato Sarker, 2026-11-02; reviewed again by 2027-05-01.
CVE-2026-0994 exp:2027-05-01
